   - Handles both single and double curly brace variable formats
   - Is memoized using useCallback to maintain consistent reference
   - Has better null/undefined handling

3. Made the translation function more defensive with error handling and fallbacks

4. Used React.useCallback to ensure the translation function maintains a stable reference

